<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="color-scheme" content="dark">
  <title>Set up CAPTAiNFiN · <%= siteName %></title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/platform-shell.css">
  <style>
    .installerCard{width:min(620px,calc(100% - 32px))}
    .installerEyebrow{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.09em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#94a3b8;margin-bottom:6px}
    .setupSteps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;margin:18px 0 22px}
    .setupStep{display:grid;gap:2px;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #334155;border-radius:10px;color:#94a3b8;background:#0f172a}
    .setupStep strong{font-size:13px;color:#cbd5e1}.setupStep span{font-size:11px}
    .setupStep.active{border-color:#64748b;background:#172033}.setupStep.active strong{color:#fff}
    .installerIntro{line-height:1.6}
    .claimReason{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:start;padding:12px;margin:16px 0;border:1px solid #334155;border-radius:10px;background:#0f172a}
    .claimReason strong{display:block;margin-bottom:3px}.claimReason span{color:#94a3b8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}
    .claimReasonMark{width:24px;height:24px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:999px;background:#1e293b;color:#fff;font-weight:800}
    .codeHint{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;background:#0f172a;border:1px solid #334155;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;margin:10px 0;color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.55;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
    .codeHint code{user-select:all;color:#fff}
    .setupHelp{margin:9px 0 16px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55}
    .installerFooter{margin-top:18px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid #263244;color:#94a3b8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5}
    @media(max-width:520px){.setupSteps{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<main class="authShell">
  <section class="authCard installerCard">
    <div class="authBrand"><%= siteName %></div>
    <div class="installerEyebrow">Secure first-run setup</div>
    <div class="setupSteps" aria-label="Setup progress">
      <div class="setupStep active"><strong>1 · Verify installation</strong><span>Prove you can access this server</span></div>
      <div class="setupStep"><strong>2 · Create administrator</strong><span>Create the first local admin account</span></div>
    </div>
    <h1 class="authTitle">Verify this installation</h1>
    <p class="muted installerIntro">Before CAPTAiNFiN creates its first administrator, enter the one-time setup code generated by this server.</p>
    <div class="claimReason"><span class="claimReasonMark" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><div><strong>Why this is required</strong><span>The code proves you can access the machine running CAPTAiNFiN, so a visitor cannot claim a newly deployed portal from the internet.</span></div></div>
    <p class="setupHelp"><strong>You do not need to search application logs.</strong> Get a fresh setup code from the server with:</p>
    <div class="codeHint"><code>docker compose exec app npm run setup:claim</code></div>
    <p class="setupHelp">If the app container is not running yet, use <code>docker compose run --rm app npm run setup:claim</code>. Generating a new code invalidates any older one.</p>
    <% if (error) { %><div class="notice error"><%= error %></div><% } %>
    <form method="post" action="/setup/claim" autocomplete="off">
      <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>">
      <div class="formGroup">
        <label for="setupCode">Setup code</label>
        <input class="input" id="setupCode" name="setupCode" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false" required autofocus>
      </div>
      <div class="buttonRow"><button class="button" type="submit">Verify installation</button></div>
    </form>
    <div class="installerFooter">This setup entry point permanently locks after the first administrator is created. Your normal admin setup checklist continues inside the portal afterwards.</div>
  </section>
</main>
</body>
</html>
